  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the garlic and cook for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Add the zucchini and cook for 3-4 minutes until tender.",
    "Add the crushed tomatoes, curry paste, cumin, salt, and pepper. Stir well to combine.",
    "Add the cooked pasta to the skillet and toss with the tomato mixture.",
    "Stir in the balsamic vinegar and Parmesan cheese.",
    "Transfer the pasta to a serving dish and garnish with fresh basil leaves.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!",
    "Cook for 2-3 minutes until the cheese is melted and the sauce is bubbly."
